Rama and Ravana trade dread arrows --- Gods decry unfair foot against chariot --- Indra chariot descends with Matali --- Matali offers bow armor arrows and shakti --- Rama salutes and mounts the chariot --- Rama counters rival weapons with like for like --- Ravana hurls venomous serpent arrows --- Rama destroys snakes with golden eagles --- Ravana batters Rama Matali banner and horses --- Dire omens gather as Rama burns with wrath